# Generate a review-only enterprise network plan (physical DSA names are examples):
#   company-network plan --unicom-device wan --mobile-device lan4 \
#     --office-cidr 192.168.50.0/24 --output /tmp/company-network-plan
#
# Read uci.batch and REVIEW.md from an isolated wired LAN. There is deliberately
# no live apply/rollback command: stage with uci batch only during a human-
# approved maintenance window, inspect `uci changes`, then decide commit/reload.
# Existing loopback/DSA/default WAN/WAN6/firewall rules are not imported/deleted.
